trong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"2000G"}]}],["$","$1","19",{"children":"。这条要读准："}],["$","$1","20",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"20% × 30 天等于月额度的 6 倍，所以它不妨碍你按月正常用满"}]}],["$","$1","21",{"children":"（最快 5 天就能用光月额度），"}],["$","$1","22",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"真正卡住的是集中爆发"}]}],["$","$1","23",{"children":"——一天跑完大半个月的量、或把订阅分给一群人同时用。"}],["$","$1","24",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"升档降幅极不均匀"}]}],["$","$1","25",{"children":"：100G→1000G 每 GB 砍到三分之一（"}],["$","$1","26",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"降 70%"}]}],["$","$1","27",{"children":"），1000G→5000G 再降 40%，但 "}],["$","$1","28",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"5000G→10000G 只降 2.8%"}]}],["$","$1","29",{"children":"——"}],["$","$1","30",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"性价比拐点在 5000G 档"}]}],["$","$1","31",{"children":"，再往上纯属买量。三档「不限时」一次性包每 GB 是对应月付档的 "}],["$","$1","32",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"3.3～5.9 倍"}]}],["$","$1","33",{"children":"，别碰。"}],["$","$1","34",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"它只卖月付、没有年付，本站认为这反而是好事"}]}],["$","$1","35",{"children":"：不必为一个还需要观察的低价站预付一年。两件要先知道的事："}],["$","$1","36",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"①官方 APP 和客户端已全部废弃"}]}],["$","$1","37",{"children":"，公告标题就是「必须看公告，违者封禁」，现在必须自己装第三方客户端并导入订阅；"}],["$","$1","38",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"②「一分机场跑路」是它热度最高的搜索词之一，但本站没有查到任何跑路实证"}]}],["$","$1","39",{"children":"——注册局记录显示它的域名 "}],["$","$1","40",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foregroun